msgstr ""
"ໄປທີ່ເອກະສານໂຄງການໂດຍໃຊ້ປຸ່ມລັດ ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງໂຄງສ້າງໂຟນເດີໄດ້ຕາມຄວາມສະດວກຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: accounting_firm
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:accounting_firm.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Having access in record time to all activities and metrics from your "
"customer databases is key."
