#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:accounting_firm.x_id_expiration_date_field_res_partner
msgid "ID Expiration Date"
msgstr "ວັນໝົດອາຍຸບັດປະຈຳຕົວ"

#. module: accounting_firm
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:accounting_firm.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Identity management is a must do activity in your business and to support "
"you with that, the contacts encompass all the necessary."
msgstr ""
"ການຈັດການຕົວຕົນແມ່ນວຽກທີ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຮັດໃນທຸລະກິດຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍທ່ານໃນເລື່ອງນີ້, ລະບົບຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່ໄດ້ລ"
"ວມເອົາທຸກສິ່ງທີ່ຈຳເປັນໄວ້ແລ້ວ."

#. module: accounting_firm
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:accounting_firm.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If you want to easily discover every features of this package, try "
"downloading the Demo Data."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການສຳຫຼວດທຸກໆຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງຊຸດໂປຣແກຣມນີ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍ, ລອງດາວໂຫຼດ ຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງ."

#. module: accounting_firm
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:accounting_firm.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If you wish to introduce a timesheet approval step prior billing your "
"customer, you can do so from the Timesheets App settings, Billing section "
"and adjusting the Invoicing Policy."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມຂັ້ນຕອນການອະນຸມັດບັນທຶກເວລາກ່ອນຮຽກເກັບເງິນຈາກລູກຄ້າ, ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ຈາກ ການ"
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າແອັບບັນທຶກເວລາ, ໝວດການຮຽກເກັບເງິນ ແລະ ປັບແຕ່ງນະໂຍບາຍການອອກໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້."

#. module: accounting_firm
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:accounting_firm.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If you wish you can introduce sections in your sale order to structure it by "
"year of follow up or simply add a note to the product line for example."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕ້ອງການ, ທ່ານສາມາດແບ່ງໝວດໃນໃບສັ່ງຂາຍເພື່ອຈັດໂຄງສ້າງຕາມປີຕິດຕາມ ຫຼື ພຽງແຕ່ເພີ່ມບັນທຶກໃສ່ແຖວສິນຄ້າ"
"ກໍໄດ້."

#. module: accounting_firm
#: model:project.task.type,name:accounting_firm.project_task_type_2
msgid "In progress"
msgstr "ພວມດຳເນີນການ"

#. module: accounting_firm
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:accounting_firm.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"In the Database tab, set the appropriate hosting option and then fill in the "
"additional required inputs, including API credentials provided by your "
"customer."
msgstr ""
"ໃນແຖບຖານຂໍ້ມູນ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຮູບແບບໂຮສຕິ້ງທີ່ເໝາະສົມ ແລ້ວປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ລວມທັງຂໍ້ມູນຢັ້ງຢືນຕົວຕົນ "
"API ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຈາກລູກຄ້າຂອງທ່ານ."

