msgid "October"
msgstr "ຕຸລາ"

#. module: accounting_firm
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:accounting_firm.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"On upload of a document, you receive an activity which is visible in the "
"notification for the Documents app."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອມີການອັບໂຫຼດເອກະສານ, ທ່ານຈະໄດ້ຮັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນກິດຈະກຳ ເຊິ່ງສະແດງຢູ່ໃນການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຂອງແອັບເອກ"
"ະສານ."

#. module: accounting_firm
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:accounting_firm.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Once confirmed, by your customer, the quote turns into a sales order, which "
"creates the corresponding project and tasks in the projects (where you "
"manage your workload)."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອລູກຄ້າຢືນຢັນແລ້ວ, ໃບສະເໜີລາຄາຈະກາຍເປັນໃບສັ່ງຂາຍ, ເຊິ່ງຈະສ້າງໂຄງການ ແລະ ໜ້າວຽກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຂຶ້ນມ"
"າໃນໂຄງການ (ບ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້ຈັດການພາລະວຽກຂອງທ່ານ)."

#. module: accounting_firm
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:accounting_firm.x_mandate_ids_field_res_partner
msgid "Online platform mandates you have for this customer"
msgstr "ການມອບສິດແພລັດຟອມອອນລາຍທີ່ທ່ານມີສຳລັບລູກຄ້ານີ້"

#. module: accounting_firm
#: model:ir.actions.server,name:accounting_firm.parner_link_action
msgid "Open link for company"
msgstr "ເປີດລິ້ງສຳລັບບໍລິສັດ"

#. module: accounting_firm
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:accounting_firm.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the <strong>CRM App</strong> in case this is the fruit of an "
"opportunity, and then click the New quotation button to transform this into "
"a quotation.<br/>\n"
"Otherwise, open the <strong>Sales App</strong> and create a new quote."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ <strong>ແອັບ CRM</strong> ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດມາຈາກໂອກາດທາງທຸລະກິດ, ແລ້ວກົດປຸ່ມ ສ້າງໃບສະ"
"ເໜີລາຄາໃໝ່ ເພື່ອປ່ຽນເປັນໃບສະເໜີລາຄາ.<br/>\n"
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເປີດ <strong>ແອັບການຂາຍ</strong> ແລ້ວສ້າງໃບສະເໜີລາຄາໃໝ່."

#. module: accounting_firm
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:accounting_firm.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the <strong>CRM App</strong>."
msgstr "ເປີດ <strong>ແອັບ CRM</strong>."

#. module: accounting_firm
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:accounting_firm.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the <strong>Contacts App</strong> and reach your new customer form."
msgstr "ເປີດ <strong>ແອັບຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່</strong> ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ຟອມລູກຄ້າໃໝ່ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: accounting_firm
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:accounting_firm.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the <strong>Project App</strong> and open the project corresponding to "
"the sale order you just confirmed, or click the Tasks smart button at the "
"top of the sale order."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ <strong>ແອັບໂຄງການ</strong> ແລ້ວເປີດໂຄງການທີ່ກົງກັບໃບສັ່ງຂາຍທີ່ທ່ານຫາກໍ່ຢືນຢັນ, ຫຼື ກົດປຸ່ມອັດສ"
"ະລິຍະ ໜ້າວຽກ ຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງໃບສັ່ງຂາຍ."

#. module: accounting_firm
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:accounting_firm.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the <strong>Project App</strong> or navigate to the sale order "
"associated tasks with the smart button at the top."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ <strong>ແອັບໂຄງການ</strong> ຫຼື ໄປທີ່ໜ້າວຽກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບໃບສັ່ງຂາຍດ້ວຍປຸ່ມອັດສະລິຍະຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງ."

#. module: accounting_firm
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:accounting_firm.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the <strong>Project App</strong>, open the project pointed by your "
"Customer onboarding product and display the project shortcut for Documents "
"if not yet done."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ <strong>ແອັບໂຄງການ</strong>, ເປີດໂຄງການທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໂດຍສິນຄ້າ ການຮັບລູກຄ້າໃໝ່ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ ແລ"
"ະ ສະແດງປຸ່ມລັດໂຄງການສຳລັບເອກະສານ ຖ້າຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ເປີດ."

#. module: accounting_firm
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:accounting_firm.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the <strong>Sales App</strong> and open the sale order you want to "
"expense."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ <strong>ແອັບການຂາຍ</strong> ແລ້ວເປີດໃບສັ່ງຂາຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການບັນທຶກຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍ."

#. module: accounting_firm
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:accounting_firm.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the Customer onboarding task to edit the action list."
msgstr "ເປີດໜ້າວຽກ ການຮັບລູກຄ້າໃໝ່ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂລາຍການການກະທຳ."

#. module: accounting_firm
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:accounting_firm.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Databases App to have your customer database metrics at your finger "
"tips!"
msgstr ""
"ເປີດແອັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ເພື່ອກວດເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຊີ້ວັດຖານຂໍ້ມູນລູກຄ້າຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍ!"

#. module: accounting_firm
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:accounting_firm.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Project App and click the Overview button from the top bar, so that "
"you can easily reach the project details. From there, leverage the smart "
"buttons to capture costs and more."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດແອັບໂຄງການ ແລ້ວກົດປຸ່ມ ພາບລວມ ຈາກແຖບດ້ານເທິງ ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດໂຄງການໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍ. "
"ຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃຊ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກປຸ່ມອັດສະລິຍະເພື່ອບັນທຶກຕົ້ນທຶນ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#. module: accounting_firm
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:accounting_firm.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Sales App and navigate from the menu to To Invoice, Services &amp; "
"Materials."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດແອັບການຂາຍ ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ເມນູ ລໍຖ້າອອກໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້, ການບໍລິການ &amp; ວັດສະດຸ."

#. module: accounting_firm
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:accounting_firm.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Timesheets App, add a line selecting the project and task you "
"worked on, and inputing the time spent today."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດແອັບບັນທຶກເວລາ, ເພີ່ມແຖວໂດຍການເລືອກໂຄງການ ແລະ ໜ້າວຽກທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ເຮັດ, ແລ້ວປ້ອນເວລາທີ່ໃຊ້ໄປໃນມື້"
"ນີ້."

#. module: accounting_firm
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:accounting_firm.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the contact form of the company you have to handle this for, Second "
"Company for example."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດຟອມຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່ຂອງບໍລິສັດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງຈັດການວຽກນີ້, ຕົວຢ່າງ: Second Company."

#. module: accounting_firm
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:accounting_firm.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the contact from which you expect the UBO list."
msgstr "ເປີດຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່ທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງລໍຖ້າລາຍຊື່ UBO."

#. module: accounting_firm
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:accounting_firm.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the task you were working on, go to the Timesheets tab and add a new "
"line."
msgstr "ເປີດໜ້າວຽກທີ່ທ່ານພວມເຮັດ, ໄປທີ່ແຖບ ບັນທຶກເວລາ ແລ້ວເພີ່ມແຖວໃໝ່."

#. module: accounting_firm
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:accounting_firm.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the the project you worked on."
msgstr "ເປີດໂຄງການທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ເຮັດວຽກ."

